{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ToV1mUAGoU1792676340.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港賽車手區天駿，於世界耐力錦標賽西班牙站，奪得組別亞軍。</p><p></p><p>區天駿與兩位隊友駕駛10號麥拿侖，在所屬LMGT3組別，今季第二次排頭位出賽，於巴塞羅那鬥六小時。</p><p></p><p>區天駿早段領先，但受天雨影響，名次開始下滑，其後又因違反黃旗規定，被罰通過維修站。接棒的隊友再因碰撞，要入維修站搶修，一度跌出前十。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_JS.RACING.AU-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fXHCzjC7Li1792676349.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>最後大約兩小時，受惠於安全車出動，車隊重新進佔前列，最後以組別第二名衝線，繼五月比利時站奪冠後，再上頒獎台，壓軸戰下月意大利上演。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:30.108613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:07.056939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:22.445531+00:00","content_hash":"e0ffbf3bdfb86b198d131515efb9b05e79f058a66290e669393ab17c4a63f209","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:30.108613+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}